      "kind": "measurement",
      "subject": "stat long taim ... i go inap long dispela de",
      "rationale": "Em i skelim taim — stat long maigraet long Mitsrayim i kam inap long nau."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Na i kamap olsem, olgeta man i lukim i tok: Sampela samting olsem i no kamap, i no lukim, stat long taim ol pikinini bilong Yisrael i kamap antap long graun bilong Mitsrayim, i go inap long dispela de; putim ⟨em⟩ long bel bilong yu, wanem i gutpela, na tokaut.",
